                "entry_id": "56cdddc1-2006-35a3-a661-c1bc705f47b7",
                "word": "cismec",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "ec546fe9-4c86-45a7-9bde-5edb16e3ef15",
                        "entry_id": "56cdddc1-2006-35a3-a661-c1bc705f47b7",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "cismecs"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a0da682c-1347-3c67-b1d3-7f8ffb09eba3",
                        "entry_id": "56cdddc1-2006-35a3-a661-c1bc705f47b7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Homme cisgenre."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "familiar"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4e96ce20-2d79-4ae1-9809-ca852e185512",
                                "sense_id": "a0da682c-1347-3c67-b1d3-7f8ffb09eba3",
                                "text": "Encore un cismec blanc (dont les privilèges découlent du genre / couleur de peau) qui dit que le genre et la couleur de peau comptent pas"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "71428f82-477c-48ce-8a99-3027318e0fb2",
                                "sense_id": "a0da682c-1347-3c67-b1d3-7f8ffb09eba3",
                                "text": "Mais en plus, quand tu vis avec un individu de type cismec en étant une meuf, tu dois aussi te coltiner des dynamiques héritées du patriarcat"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "75dbd89b-6bf0-4e42-a55b-43fbe3f006fb",
                                "sense_id": "a0da682c-1347-3c67-b1d3-7f8ffb09eba3",
                                "text": "Dilemne du cismec de droite: Panneau à bouton rouge de gauche: “Les migrants sont tous des violeurs qui violent nos femmes.” Panneau à bouton rouge de droite: “Nos femmes sont toutes des serpents qui mentent à propos du viol.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a3ae6ba3-c7b6-49a6-8b4d-13147b7ca01c",
                                "sense_id": "a0da682c-1347-3c67-b1d3-7f8ffb09eba3",
                                "text": "Quand un cismec nous envoie une photo de son pénis sans qu'on ait rien demandé : nᵒ 1 Envoyer une photo de carotte en train d'être râpée, d'un concombre en train d'être épluché par un économe, d'une banane en train d'être coupée en rondelles par un grand couteau, etc… nᵒ 2 Envoyer une photo de son caca au gond des toilettes. nᵒ 3 - J'espère que vous avez gardé le ticket… Il est encore sous garantie ? Vous pouvez toujours l'échanger ? nᵒ 4 - Je sais que tu en es fier. Comme mon chat quand il me rapporte une souris morte. Mais c'est dégueulasse et je vais m'empresser d'aller jeter ça. nᵒ 5 - Oh mon dieu, ça va ? nᵒ 6 - HAN MANDIEU, MAIS T'AS [insérer infection] !!!!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fb34d594-367a-453a-821b-d2d1b64f2f5b",
                                "sense_id": "a0da682c-1347-3c67-b1d3-7f8ffb09eba3",
                                "text": "Si t’arrives ici de nulle part : salut, moi je suis Hel (ça se prononce Tchèl parce que c’est pas du français mais bref), je suis une personne non-binaire en couple depuis plus de sept ans avec un cismec qui (tel le trope de la Woman born yesterday) arrive à avancer dans la vie sans avoir la moindre idée de sa bogossitude (en toute objectivité, évidemment)."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3526e168-ad4c-4bfc-81a1-64a6f825b0b3",
                        "source_entry_id": "56cdddc1-2006-35a3-a661-c1bc705f47b7",
                        "source_sense_id": "a0da682c-1347-3c67-b1d3-7f8ffb09eba3",
                        "target_lang_word": "cisguy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cisguy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5f683969-9cf4-3d9b-a71f-aa9f9989d93f",
                                        "entry_id": "8b81f41c-a032-3960-be83-b9cbbb026dde",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A cisgender man."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "738dfa1f-a13d-4e5f-b91f-dd37faec5b80",
                                                "sense_id": "5f683969-9cf4-3d9b-a71f-aa9f9989d93f",
                                                "text": "\"This is not about sex!\" I snapped. \"I mean, yes, I was interested in being with a cisguy after my surgery, but–\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52582b48-73c2-4561-a578-73beab230abe",
                                                "sense_id": "5f683969-9cf4-3d9b-a71f-aa9f9989d93f",
                                                "text": "The humorous guide, which is full of illustrations (cartoons, photos, diagrams), is written for a young, fashion-conscious FTM audience that seeks to pass among cisguys."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e9b79cd-c071-4918-b414-15169355ad97",
                                                "sense_id": "5f683969-9cf4-3d9b-a71f-aa9f9989d93f",
                                                "text": "[…] the most known or visible representation is typically a White cisguy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ce4faad0-5b0b-4d81-836d-b6a6dd3706bb",
                        "source_entry_id": "56cdddc1-2006-35a3-a661-c1bc705f47b7",
                        "source_sense_id": "a0da682c-1347-3c67-b1d3-7f8ffb09eba3",
                        "target_lang_word": "cisdude",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cisdude",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "90d23d62-91a0-3e70-af87-69453bbb3870",
                                        "entry_id": "f3941125-95b1-3b9d-8229-74a6f56f96a8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A cisgender man."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26492c3a-d10a-43c9-a9f1-6d0f07398e36",
                                                "sense_id": "90d23d62-91a0-3e70-af87-69453bbb3870",
                                                "text": "The Pride parade in particular is heavily weighted toward cisdudes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aca346aa-aa20-41c3-b126-2c1775648015",
                                                "sense_id": "90d23d62-91a0-3e70-af87-69453bbb3870",
                                                "text": "I’m a 25-year-old fat, brown, queer cisdude."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6499ea2-8462-40af-ab29-3e5cbb2cbadc",
                                                "sense_id": "90d23d62-91a0-3e70-af87-69453bbb3870",
                                                "text": "In Brighton, a lot of gigs are billed as ‘queer’, I think because we are known as a queer town or something? But like, you turn up and the bands are all cisdudes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "06547408-665a-4cf1-89a7-2308eafb8d80",
                        "source_entry_id": "56cdddc1-2006-35a3-a661-c1bc705f47b7",
                        "source_sense_id": "a0da682c-1347-3c67-b1d3-7f8ffb09eba3",
                        "target_lang_word": "cisman",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cisman",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9633c8d2-630b-358e-a71f-c0ce4649a457",
                                        "entry_id": "b70f021f-8b4a-397c-acc9-4591b73667ce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative spelling of cis man."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc34bab5-f2e4-4289-aa24-6c06973bc027",
                                                "sense_id": "9633c8d2-630b-358e-a71f-c0ce4649a457",
                                                "text": "Not only do people harass and attack transwomen for being who they are: transwomen also face scrutiny from both ciswomen and cismen over “what” they are."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d9bd253-1131-4bc4-b22c-713a697640ca",
                                                "sense_id": "9633c8d2-630b-358e-a71f-c0ce4649a457",
                                                "text": "The origin of the embryo is no longer intercourse of a ciswoman and a cisman, but a technological procedure."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a7c80736-2c49-413a-b41b-91a68264faee",
                        "source_entry_id": "56cdddc1-2006-35a3-a661-c1bc705f47b7",
                        "source_sense_id": "a0da682c-1347-3c67-b1d3-7f8ffb09eba3",
                        "target_lang_word": "cisboy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cisboy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d5c133bf-692e-32e3-b831-f878049b886a",
                                        "entry_id": "26b88f87-e8d0-3fd7-b488-417efb8ff648",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A cisgender man or boy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a9af75d-76aa-48f7-ab72-04bceed7dc66",
                                                "sense_id": "d5c133bf-692e-32e3-b831-f878049b886a",
                                                "text": "Indeed, the heavy and active involvement of (cis)women soldiers in the torture of prisoners stands in clear contradiction to not only the U.S. military's self-image as the quintessential masculine institution that turns cisboys into cismen, but also seems to falsify feminist scholarship on the foundational role of militarized masculinity in military operations […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce959fd8-e5a8-4a69-837d-6948c5596823",
                                                "sense_id": "d5c133bf-692e-32e3-b831-f878049b886a",
                                                "text": "Of course, cisboys and trans girls may also want and obtain these items (and clearly, many do), but representing them as specifically girls' toys overdetermines their location."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55c784e3-b3a6-4913-b414-64cb6bc2b9a0",
                                                "sense_id": "d5c133bf-692e-32e3-b831-f878049b886a",
                                                "text": "We had a bunch of cis-girls and cis-boys in the unit."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
